{"seq":3,"slug":"globalization-neoliberalism","title":"全球化与新自由主义","stage":"DONE","category":"political-economy","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"全球化与新自由主义-简介\">全球化与新自由主义 简介</h1><p>全球化和新自由主义是塑造当代世界政治经济格局的两股最强大的力量。它们相互交织、彼此强化，共同推动了资本、商品和劳动力在全球范围内的流动，也引发了深刻的社会矛盾和政治反弹。本知识库从理论和实践两个维度，系统分析全球化进程与新自由主义思想的内在逻辑及其社会后果。</p>\n<p>本知识库适合对国际政治经济学、全球治理和发展研究感兴趣的读者，尤其适合希望理解当代全球不平等、贸易冲突和反全球化运动背后深层原因的学习者。无论你关注的是国际贸易政策、全球产业链重组还是社会运动，都能在本知识库中找到有价值的分析视角。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>全球化理论与进程</strong>从全球化的概念争论出发，梳理经济全球化、文化全球化和政治全球化的多重维度，分析全球化进程的历史阶段和驱动力量。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>新自由主义思想与实践</strong>深入剖析新自由主义的理论源流和政策实践，从哈耶克和弗里德曼的思想谱系到华盛顿共识和结构调整方案，揭示新自由主义如何从边缘学说上升为全球主导意识形态。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>全球产业链与劳动</strong>聚焦全球化对生产组织和劳动关系的具体影响，分析全球价值链的形成、国际分工的演变以及劳动标准的跨国博弈。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>反全球化与替代方案</strong>转向全球化的批判和抵抗维度，考察反全球化运动的兴起、逆全球化趋势的成因以及公平贸易和替代经济等探索性实践。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径是按章节顺序阅读。先通过第一章建立全球化的整体认知，再在第二章中理解新自由主义作为全球化意识形态引擎的角色，接着在第三章中观察全球化的具体经济影响，最后在第四章中思考替代性的可能路径。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"globalization-theory","title":"全球化理论与进程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/globalization-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"globalization-debates","title":"全球化概念：经济、政治与文化全球化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/globalization-theory/globalization-debates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"economic-globalization","title":"全球化简史：从丝绸之路到信息革命","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/globalization-theory/economic-globalization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cultural-globalization","title":"超级全球化争论：特里芬困境与罗德里克三难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/globalization-theory/cultural-globalization"},{"seq":4,"slug":"political-globalization","title":"去全球化：逆全球化趋势与供应链重组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/globalization-theory/political-globalization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"neoliberalism","title":"新自由主义思想与实践","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/neoliberalism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neoliberal-thought","title":"新自由主义起源：哈耶克、弗里德曼与芝加哥学派","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/neoliberalism/neoliberal-thought"},{"seq":2,"slug":"washington-consensus","title":"华盛顿共识：十条政策与全球推广","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/neoliberalism/washington-consensus"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structural-adjustment","title":"新自由主义批判：不平等、私有化与金融不稳定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/neoliberalism/structural-adjustment"},{"seq":4,"slug":"neoliberal-critique","title":"后华盛顿共识：制度主义转向与包容性增长","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/neoliberalism/neoliberal-critique"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-production","title":"全球产业链与劳动","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/global-production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"global-value-chains","title":"全球财富分配：1% vs 99% 与皮凯蒂 r>g","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/global-production/global-value-chains"},{"seq":2,"slug":"international-division-labor","title":"南北差距：核心-边缘结构与不平等交换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/global-production/international-division-labor"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-labor-standards","title":"移民与劳动：国际劳工迁移、汇款经济与脑力流失","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/global-production/global-labor-standards"},{"seq":4,"slug":"race-to-bottom","title":"技术鸿沟：数字鸿沟、技术转移与创新不平等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/globalization-neoliberalism/global-production/race-to-bottom"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"anti-globalization","title":"反全球化与替代方案","doc